(FLW-42 (undocumented precision): the exit code is the POSIX process
 status, so it is taken modulo 256 - `Exit 300.` leaves status 44. The
 code may also be a variable rather than a literal (hand-run separately:
 `Exit code.` with code=7 exits 7).
 Ran: VOX_CORE_PATH=/home/josj/scr/english/vox/coreasm /home/josj/scr/english/vox/target/release/vox FLW-42.vox -o p && ./p
 expected output:
   before
   exit 44
)
print "before".
Exit 300.
